{"path":"regex/regex_iterator/operator_cmp","title":"std::regex_iterator<BidirIt,CharT,Traits>::operator==,operator!=","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::regex_iterator&lt;BidirIt,CharT,Traits&gt;::</span>operator==,operator!=","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/regex/regex_iterator/operator_cmp","section":"regex","kind":"page","summary":"For the sake of exposition, assume that regex_iterator contains the following members:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy1\">==</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> regex_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11 t-until-cxx20\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> operator<span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> regex_iterator<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> rhs <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx20\">(until C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Compares two <code>regex_iterator</code>s.\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<p>The <code>!=</code> operator is <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/default_comparisons#Other_defaulted_comparison_operators\">synthesized</a> from <code>operator==</code>.\n</p>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rhs\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <code>regex_iterator</code> to compare to\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>For the sake of exposition, assume that <code>regex_iterator</code> contains the following members:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code>BidirIt begin</code>;\n</li><li> <code>BidirIt end</code>;\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> regex_type <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>pregex<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_flag_type\"><span class=\"kw2055\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regex_constants</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">match_flag_type</span></span></a> flags<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/regex/match_results\"><span class=\"kw2024\">std::<span class=\"me2\">match_results</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>BidirIt<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> match<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</li></ul>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rhs</span></code> are both end-of-sequence iterators, or if all of the following conditions are true:\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">begin <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">end <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">end</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">pregex <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">pregex</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">flags <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">flags</span></span></code>\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">match<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">match</span><span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"nu0\">0</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span></span></code></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"regex","title":"Regular expressions library (since C++11)"},{"path":"regex/regex_iterator","title":"std::regex_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::regex_iterator<BidirIt,CharT,Traits>::operator==,operator!=","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11, until C++20. Compares two regex_iterators."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rhs"},{"label":"Return value","note":"For the sake of exposition, assume that regex_iterator contains the following members:"},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":114,"codeBlockCount":0}
